interaction page-composition-reads-owner-material
  source surface-pattern
  destination page-composition
  relation composes_owner_streams
  preserves canonical owner reader, publication status and visibility, community moderation state, safe same-origin media paths, source attribution by label, and the world's published fragment edges
  drops source catalogue headings, per-source shelving, character name as copy, raw subject-address schemes and the visible reading-boundary prose
  forbidden_inference a region rendering material -> that material's owner having admitted it for any purpose beyond public reading
  invalidates_on world, world_fragment, publication_occurrence, internet_source, community_post, media_program, music_recording or page-composition.cue changes
  witness cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/tests/page_composition_test.sh

interaction page-composition-hands-off-compatibility-scene
  source page-composition
  destination surface-ir
  relation server_emitted_compatibility_scene
  preserves exact server-emitted region order, stable region continuity, public/self actor scope, owner-projection fingerprint and the compatibility boundary
  drops source truth, identity, authority, availability, price, proof, commitment, presence and effect state
  forbidden_inference a compatibility Scene or projected runtime asset -> an active browser binding, a client compositor, or authority to fetch/derive owner material
  invalidates_on PageComposition region plan, owner projection fingerprint, addressed route/filter cut or SurfaceRuntime scene contract changes
  witness cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/tests/page_surface_scene_test.sh
  binding cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/src/main.c
  binding cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/Makefile
  binding cmd/BonfyreSurfaceScene/runtime/surface-runtime.mjs

interaction page-composition-publishes-complete-route-walk
  source page-composition
  destination web-lowering
  relation exports_server_declared_route_continuation
  preserves the exact public host, route, page-length order, server-emitted next link, and immutable HTML bytes for each emitted length
  drops source admission authority, raw retained bodies, reader identity, personalization, browser-side composition, and any claim that an exported page is a live source reading
  forbidden_inference a source appearing in a static route length -> endorsement, editorial ranking, source authority, current availability, or a claim that the page is live
  invalidates_on page-composition.cue, public route source selection, or static export continuation changes
  witness scripts/tests/export_static_estate_depth_test.sh
  binding scripts/export_static_estate.sh

interaction source-frontier-lowers-source-depth-cut
  source source-frontier
  destination page-composition
  relation maintains_ledger_cut
  preserves exact admitted coordinate, recorded standing, publisher/family relation, retained-carriage measurements and bounded index position
  drops unrelated retained body content, route-level item selection, source quality judgement, endpoint liveness and authority to fetch again
  forbidden_inference a SourceDepth page -> current source availability, public-program contribution, endorsement or a claim about what its publisher now says
  invalidates_on channel state, exact address, publisher/family membership, recorded carriage or bounded index membership
  witness cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/tests/page_channels_test.sh

interaction page-composition-materializes-subject-route-representation
  source page-composition
  destination representation-manifold
  relation compiles_request_ready_route_cut
  preserves exact subject and scope, admitted reader coordinates, published SourceCollection and SitePresentation inputs, normalized item bytes, route grammar, compiler identity, committed output digest and reconstruction inputs
  drops source admission authority, provider freshness, subject identity promotion, rights, and every human or institutional effect
  forbidden_inference a verified compiled route -> current external truth, authority to act, or proof that every possible presentation is resident
  invalidates_on admitted SubjectFabric reader, Scene query, published SourceCollection or SitePresentation, normalized item stream, page grammar, surface program, or compiler changing
  binding cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tools/compile_subject_projection.mjs
  binding cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tools/verify_subject_projection.mjs
  binding scripts/bonfyre_automate.mjs
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/subject_projection_precompute_test.sh

